          "why": "A cluster of seed rounds — Mountain Protocol, Reflect, Agora Dollar backed by Dragonfly, and Cap led by Franklin Templeton — revealed an intensifying race to own the yield-bearing stablecoin infrastructure layer, which readers followed as a competitive bracket."
